@startuml 14-state-game-phases
!pragma layout smetana
title Game phases and transitions

[*] --> SETUP : /game create
SETUP : players join, role pool,\nfamilies, assignment, channels
SETUP --> DAY : /game start (day 1)
SETUP --> ENDED : /gm end_game

DAY : day actions, mayor election (day 1)\nlynch open after the newspaper
DAY --> DAY : NEWSPAPER 12:00\npublic roles, lynch opens
DAY --> NIGHT : DUSK 19:00\nlynch result, day actions,\nwolves' vote opens

NIGHT : night actions\n(second lynch until 20:00 if called)
NIGHT --> NIGHT : SECOND_LYNCH_END 20:00
NIGHT --> SLEEP : NIGHT_LOCK 00:00\npreview for the GMs

SLEEP : actions locked\nGM adjustments
SLEEP --> DAY : MORNING 08:00\nnight applied, day += 1

DAY --> ENDED : /gm end_game
NIGHT --> ENDED : /gm end_game
SLEEP --> ENDED : /gm end_game
ENDED : data kept until /game delete
ENDED --> [*] : /game delete
@enduml
